Back to <a href=\"https://grey.colorado.edu/CompCogNeuro/index.php/CCNBook/Sims/All\" title=\"CCNBook/Sims/All\">CCNBook/Sims/All</a> or <a href=\"https://grey.colorado.edu/CompCogNeuro/index.php/CCNBook/Neuron\" title=\"CCNBook/Neuron\">Neuron Chapter</a>.
</p>
